{c: Verse 1}
[Dm]chupana bhi nahin [C]aata,        [Dm]batana bhi nahin [C]aata
[Dm]hume tumse [C]mohabbat hai,        [F]jatana [C]bhi [Dm]nahin aata
[Dm]hatheli par [A#]tumhara Naam,        [C]likhte hain [F]lithate hain
