[Dm]sunana hi nahin [C]aata,        [Dm]hume tumse ...
[Dm]mohabbat kaise [A#]karte hain,        [C]koi to humko [F]batlaaye
[Dm]kahin aisa [Am]na ho ki,        [C]pyaar [F]ki umr [Dm]kat jaaye
[C]pyaar [F]ki umr [Dm]kat jaaye,        [Dm]tumse milna ka [C]koi [Dm]
bahana bhi nahin [C]aata,        [Dm]hume tumse ...
[Dm]chori chori [A#]chupke chupke,        [C]tumko dekha [F]karte hain
[Dm]haal e dil [Am]sunane se [C],        naa jaane [F]kyun dar [Dm]te hain
